and dumped into Gray Terminal.

52
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:52,260
Here it comes! Let's go!

53
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:53,834
Treasure hunting time!

54
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,220
From time to time,

55
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:57,257
residents of Gray Terminal will enter the

56
00:04:57,340 --> 00:05:00,080
city to sell what they
call recycled goods.

57
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:06,710
Hey, wait!

58
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,433
What's in that package?

59
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,880
Crocodile skin.

60
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:14,280
Want it? What?

61
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:18,240
Go ahead.

62
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:23,557
Beyond the Great Gate
is a boulevard through

63
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:26,380
which everyone entering
the city must pass.

64
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,840
It leads to Edgetown.

65
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,649
Edgetown, populated by
thugs and criminals,

66
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:39,781
lacks the refinement seen
in the rest of the city.

67
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,860
Hey there, buddy.

68
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:48,574
Need some help with that heavy package?

69
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:54,380
Hey, answer me when I speak to you.

70
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,740
Buzz off. What?

71
00:06:00,820 --> 00:06:01,960
You're dead!

72
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:04,594
Gotta pick your targets more carefully.

73
00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:08,820
You might get more than you bargained for.

74
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:12,380
Aw, dammit, not them! Look out!

75
00:06:13,100 --> 00:06:15,340
No mercy! All right!

76
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:36,980
In the middle of the city, another
stone wall reaches to the skies.

77
00:06:37,980 --> 00:06:40,380
This one encloses Hightown,

78
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:44,461
which separates those with noble
blood from their lesser neighbors.

79
00:06:47,020 --> 00:06:49,820
This is the shining
jewel of the Goa kingdom.

80
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:53,497
Said to be the most beautiful
country in all of the East Blue,

81
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:56,404
not a hint of trash can
be found on its streets.

82
00:06:58,460 --> 00:07:01,040
Windmill Village can make no such claim.

83
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:04,377
And although it's technically
a part of the Goa Kingdom!,

84
00:07:04,460 --> 00:07:06,277
the fact is often swept under the rug?

85
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:08,242
by its more wealthy inhabitants.

86
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,740
Three bowls of ramen.

87
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,420
Thank you for waiting.

88
00:07:18,740 --> 00:07:19,681
Enjoy your meal.

89
00:07:21,660 --> 00:07:23,480
So this is ramen, huh?

90
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,320
Whoa, looks good.

91
00:07:27,140 --> 00:07:28,720
Well, eat it already.

92
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:36,156
Took the words right out of my mouth!

93
00:07:39,540 --> 00:07:40,481
Seconds, please!

94
00:07:42,620 --> 00:07:44,300
We require seconds!

95
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,405
Three more bowls, boo's taste!

96
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:48,500
Yes, sir, on the way!

97
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:49,980
May I come in?

98
00:07:58,620 --> 00:08:00,117
You might want to see this!

99
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:01,030
Are you sure?

100
